    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300cTouhou: Tales of the Scarlet\u300dis a Roguelike Deckbuilder. You will play as Flandre Scarlet to initiate a \u201cScarlet Moon Incident\u201d and duel with gensokyo girls. The game strategies are not limited to attacking, defending, and moving. Make good use of knock-backs and duplicates, and effectively deal with the unique map mechanism, and let the scarlet moonlight shine upon this land!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183200/extras/42e25e3ee5e439f906d257bd6590cb7d.avif?t=1754887808\" data-has-big width=800 height=413 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ unique battles, we have carefully designed battle performances for each character.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 unique battle scenes, experience using strategies to fight at various scenic spots in Gensokyo.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 boss battles, against Gensokyo girls who master powerful spell cards.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card construction ideas unique to Flandre Scarlet, 200+ usable cards.</p></li></ul>",
